1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,000
At dawn, Emi follows the map’s blue line toward civic stone waking silver between the twin towers.

2
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:14,500
Morning gathers at Park Tower, where warm coffee steadies Emi and granite steps divide the city into terraces.

3
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:21,800
By late morning, Nomura’s fins turn Emi’s route into a chart, each window marking someone’s work.

4
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:29,200
At noon, Emi eats beneath Center Building’s glass skin, briefly inside a city perfectly ordered.

5
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:37,200
Afternoon sharpens on Mitsui’s black X-braces, while Emi’s messages pulse like small private stars behind the façade.

6
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:44,500
At dusk, Cocoon Tower wraps Emi in woven light, its curving lattice turning traffic into one luminous thread.

7
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:52,000
Evening, Miraina Tower lifts Emi above the rails; every arriving train stitches another life into the map.

8
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:59,300
By night, Kabukicho Tower’s fountain conducts the crowds, and Emi closes her map on the city’s electric pulse.
